<main id="main">
<section class="hero wrap" aria-labelledby="hero-title">
  <div class="hero-copy"><p class="eyebrow"><span class="status-dot"></span> BUILT FOR NPs &amp; PAs. ROOTED IN NORTH TEXAS.</p><h1 id="hero-title">Your own clinic.<br><em>A little less<br>on your shoulders.</em></h1><p class="hero-description">You bring the vision for better care. We help handle the steps to opening your cash-pay clinic—from the launch paperwork to the systems behind your first patient.</p><a class="primary-link" href="/contact">Let’s talk about your clinic <span aria-hidden="true">↗</span></a><p class="hero-note">Physician-informed experience. Hands-on execution. One clear path.</p></div>
  <div class="launch-panel" aria-label="Overview of the clinic launch process"><div class="panel-topline"><span>THE APPly APPROACH</span><span aria-hidden="true">+</span></div><h2>From an idea<br>to <em>open doors.</em></h2><div class="launch-steps">
    <% ["Your clinic, defined", "Your launch, coordinated", "Your systems, set up", "Your first patient, next"].each_with_index do |step, i| %><div class="launch-step"><span class="step-number">0<%= i + 1 %></span><span><%= step %></span></div><% end %>
  </div><div class="panel-bottom"><span class="panel-symbol" aria-hidden="true">✓</span><p>More support behind the scenes.<br><strong>More room to focus on care.</strong></p></div></div>
  <a href="#approach" class="scroll-cue">↓ A NEW WAY TO GET STARTED</a>
</section>
<section class="intro-section wrap" id="approach" aria-labelledby="approach-title">
  <div class="section-heading"><div><p class="eyebrow">YOUR EXPERTISE. YOUR PRACTICE.</p><h2 id="approach-title">Built around the provider.<br><em>Not the paperwork.</em></h2></div><p>APPly is a done-for-you clinic-launch consultancy for nurse practitioners and physician assistants in Sherman and North Texas. We turn the moving parts into a coordinated plan—and help put that plan into motion.</p></div>
  <div class="services-grid">
    <% [
      ["A plan you can act on.", "A clinic-specific launch plan and organized packet, informed by the work of setting up a real Texas practice.", ["Launch checklist & information gathering", "Paperwork coordination", "Clear responsibilities & next steps"]],
      ["The moving parts, managed.", "Hands-on coordination across the setup process, with the right questions brought to the right people.", ["Local setup & permitting coordination", "Professional-adviser coordination", "Opening-readiness planning"]],
      ["Systems with a purpose.", "Practical tools and workflows designed around the everyday work of a small cash-pay clinic.", ["Starter SharePoint patient-record setup", "Administrative workflow organization", "Team onboarding & handoff"]],
      ["Support beyond a checklist.", "A launch relationship built to continue, with ongoing support and physician mentorship in development.", ["Launch questions & issue tracking", "Ongoing support planning", "Physician-informed guidance"]]
    ].each_with_index do |(title, description, items), i| %>
      <article class="service-card"><div class="service-top"><span>0<%= i + 1 %></span></div><h3><%= title %></h3><p><%= description %></p><ul><% items.each do |item| %><li><span aria-hidden="true">✓</span><%= item %></li><% end %></ul></article>
    <% end %>
  </div><p class="scope-note">Your clinic is specific. So is your engagement. Services, professional arrangements, and ongoing support are scoped before work begins.</p>
</section>
<section class="process-section" id="process" aria-labelledby="process-title"><div class="wrap">
  <div class="section-heading"><div><p class="eyebrow">LESS GUESSWORK. MORE FORWARD MOTION.</p><h2 id="process-title">A clear path.<br><em>A hands-on partner.</em></h2></div><p>We do the coordination and execution. You stay involved where it matters: your vision, your decisions, and the responsibilities only you can own.</p></div>
  <ol class="process-grid"><% [
    ["Shape the clinic.", "We start with your services, location, and goals, then define a realistic scope of work together."],
    ["Coordinate the launch.", "We organize the packet and setup tasks, working with you and the relevant professional advisers."],
    ["Put systems in place.", "We help configure the operational tools and workflows your team will use day to day."],
    ["Prepare to open.", "We review outstanding items, hand off your setup, and agree on the support you need next."]
  ].each_with_index do |(title, description), i| %><li><span class="process-number">0<%= i + 1 %></span><h3><%= title %></h3><p><%= description %></p></li><% end %></ol>
  <a class="text-link" href="/contact">Talk through your next step ↗</a>
</div></section>
<section class="experience-section wrap" aria-labelledby="experience-title"><div class="experience-label"><p class="eyebrow">EXPERIENCE, NOT JUST A FRAMEWORK</p><span>Sherman, Texas</span></div><div><h2 id="experience-title">Built with someone<br>who’s <em>worked through the setup.</em></h2><p>Co-founder Kevin Stacks, MD, brings firsthand experience setting up a cash-pay clinic in Texas. His documented launch process is the starting point for the APPly packet and a more supported path for the next provider.</p><p class="experience-detail">That experience informs the work. Your clinic still gets its own plan, professional review, and implementation.</p><a class="text-link" href="https://stacksadultmedicine.com/" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">Meet the practice behind the experience ↗<span class="sr-only"> (opens in a new tab)</span></a></div></section>
<section class="faq-section wrap" id="questions"><div><p class="eyebrow">A FEW THINGS YOU MAY BE WONDERING</p><h2>Good questions.<br><em>Clear answers.</em></h2></div><div class="faq-list">
  <% [
    ["Who is APPly for?", "Our initial focus is nurse practitioners and physician assistants planning cash-pay primary care or concierge-adjacent clinics in Sherman and North Texas. Your provider role, services, and location shape the appropriate launch plan."],
    ["How much of the setup do you handle?", "We organize the launch work, coordinate the moving parts, and help implement the systems. You provide key information, make owner and clinical decisions, and complete approvals or signatures that require you. Responsibilities are agreed before an engagement starts."],
    ["What does the starter patient-record system look like?", "The starting point is a SharePoint-based workflow informed by a real clinic’s setup. Configuration, access controls, agreements, and workflow review are part of the clinic-specific implementation discussion. No platform is automatically compliant just because it is used for healthcare."],
    ["Do you provide legal advice or guarantee approval?", "APPly coordinates clinic-launch work; it is not a law firm. Legal advice comes from qualified counsel. Entity structure, professional arrangements, and local requirements need clinic-specific review. We do not guarantee approvals or opening dates."],
    ["Is the clinic software included?", "The launch portal includes paperwork, onboarding, and information resources. The integrated EHR, inventory, and employee-management workspace is being developed as a separately scoped product. It is not automatically included in a launch engagement."],
    ["Is support available after opening?", "Ongoing support is part of the intended service model, with physician mentorship also being developed. Availability, responsibilities, and fees will be set out in your engagement."]
  ].each do |question, answer| %><details><summary><%= question %></summary><p><%= answer %></p></details><% end %>
</div></section>
<section class="contact-cta"><div class="wrap contact-cta-inner"><div><p class="eyebrow">MAKE ROOM FOR WHAT’S NEXT</p><h2>Your clinic starts<br>with <em>a conversation.</em></h2><p>Tell us where you want to go. We’ll talk through the next step together.</p></div><a class="primary-link" href="/contact">Get in touch ↗</a></div></section>
</main>
